# USER

I want to add a new Greger client that uses openrouter. This should give access to gpt-5 and gpt-5-codex (along with other models).

I want to do it in a way that doesn't overwrite current functions, but as a separate code path that I can configure to use (it'll be in beta and I want the current working claude path to keep working). The current code _must_ continue working uninterrupted with no changes. Make a config option that pushes things to the new code path. But again, the current code must keep working unchanged!

Important: I still want to use the messages/completions API (not responses), because I want full control of the chat history.

Propose a solution in OPENROUTER_REFACTOR.md, without implementing anything.

Search the web for openrouter APIs, how to deal with thinking, tool calls, etc.

