- API endpoints and auth headers
- Message format (OpenAI vs Anthropic content blocks)
- Tool calling format (OpenAI functions vs Anthropic tools)
- Thinking/reasoning tokens (different parameter names and response fields)
- Streaming format (delta fields vs Anthropic's SSE format)

**Migration Path**: Three phases that maintain 100% backward compatibility at each step.

