**3. Thinking: NO SIGNATURES**
- Convert `reasoning` deltas to Greger thinking format
- Signature field always empty (OpenRouter doesn't provide them)
- Everything else works the same

**4. Implementation: PARALLEL**
- Zero changes to existing code
- Complete separate `greger-openrouter.el` file
- One dispatch function in `greger.el`
- All conversion logic isolated

### Key Implementation Details

```elisp
;; Web search: automatically append :online when enabled
(actual-model (if enable-web-search
                  (concat model ":online")  ; "openai/gpt-5-codex:online"
                model))

;; Citations: convert annotations to citation blocks
(when annotations
  (dolist (annotation annotations)
    (push (convert-to-citation-block annotation) blocks)))

;; Thinking: map reasoning to thinking with empty signature
(when (alist-get 'reasoning delta)
  (create-thinking-block-with-empty-signature reasoning-text))
```

